        "port": "The TCP port of the anydm server the extension is talking to: the one it dialed, which the app knows as the one it listens on. It ends the message of every proof except `secret`, so a proof made for one port is worthless on another (a relay on a different port cannot forward a pairing or a session to the real app, and the real app cannot be made to answer for it).",
        "pairKey": "While pairing the HMAC key is the UTF-8 bytes of the canonical code (16 uppercase Crockford base32 characters, 80 bits).",
        "sessionKey": "After pairing the HMAC key is the 32 raw bytes of `secret` (decode the hex).",
        "nonce": "16 random bytes, sent as 32 lowercase hex characters (nonceE from the extension, nonceA from the app).",
        "id": "16 random bytes from the app, 32 lowercase hex characters.",
        "headers": "X-Anydm-Id: the id. X-Anydm-Counter: the counter, decimal. X-Anydm-Mac: the mac, 64 lowercase hex characters.",
        "counter": "Integer from 1 to 9007199254740991, strictly greater than the one before in the same session (a session starts after each /hello).",
        "bodyHash": "SHA-256 of the exact request body bytes as sent, lowercase hex.",
        "inputs": "The code, the nonces and the id below are fixed inputs picked by hand (sequential bytes), not output of a random source, so that both sides get the same numbers. The Kotlin test hands them to the app through a scripted random source: the code as 16 alphabet indexes, then nonceA, then id, then the session's nonceA.",
        "formulas": {
            "proofE": "HMAC(code, 'anydm-pair-1|' + nonceE + '|' + port)",
            "proofA": "HMAC(code, 'anydm-app-1|' + nonceE + '|' + nonceA + '|' + port)",
            "secret": "HMAC(code, 'anydm-secret-1|' + nonceE + '|' + nonceA)",
            "helloRequestProof": "HMAC(secret, 'anydm-hello-req-1|' + id + '|' + nonceE + '|' + port)",
            "helloProof": "HMAC(secret, 'anydm-hello-1|' + nonceE + '|' + nonceA + '|' + port)",
            "mac": "HMAC(secret, 'anydm-req-1|' + nonceA + '|' + counter + '|' + path + '|' + sha256hex(body) + '|' + port)"
        }
    },
